        "text": "According to David L. McColgin (Petitioner), according to David L. McColgin (Petitioner), the case turns on the interpretation of 18\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f3501(c) and whether it incorporates the McNabb\u2011Mallory rule and the requirement of prompt presentment."
